I can understand why someone would want to tell everybody about the game
they just won (they couldn't resist the urge to share their feelings of 
satisfaction with other people).  But personally I would never want to impose
my long boring story on other people, unless something VERY interesting
happened during my game.  

I have also ascended twice, and will soon ascend again, but I won't whine 
about how easy the game is, at least not until I have ascended with every 
character class.  Complaining about the inconsistencies in the game is
one thing, but selfishly demanding that the game becomes more difficult,
just so that I feel challenged, is very inconsiderate, since I know quite 
well that MANY beginners do not feel that way.  After all, it was my fault
that I chose to read all those spoilers.  It's a good thing that I don't
have the source code, because I might just sacrifice some time to modify
it to make the game impossible, and send it to all those complainers just
so I do not have to hear their complains on this news board again.

I know I sound nasty, but god, I feel so *sick* of the current trend.






